    "# 🚀 ClipKontrast on Google Colab (Optimized & Latency-Reduced Workflow)\n",
    "\n",
    "> **Run everything on Colab's GPU** - Process YouTube videos with AI-powered clipping, captions, and GPU-accelerated speech-to-text.\n",
    "\n",
    "## ⚡ **Optimized for Speed**: All latency-reducing settings enabled by default\n",
    "\n",
    "Based on ClipKontrast (rebranded PeakCut) - transforms long videos into captioned vertical clips for Reels/Shorts/TikTok.\n",
    "\n",
    "**✨ Optimized Features:**\n",
    "- 🚀 YouTube transcript-first mode (70-90% faster - NO full audio download!)\n",
    "- 🖥️ GPU-accelerated STT (sherpa-onnx with offloading)\n",
    "- ⚙️ Concurrent processing for 3 videos\n",
    "- 🧠 Fast AI model configuration\n",
    "- ⏭️ Static scene skipping\n",
    "- 📊 Maximum performance tuning"
   ]
  },
